                <p>N. B. In 1933 there was a cash balance of $144,623.26 as of December 30, 1933 and
                    later used in the 1934 budget.</p>
                <pb facs="0923" n="823" xml:id="pg823"/>
                <p>There is every indication of there being another cash balance for the year 1934,
                    amounting to at best $70,000.00.</p>
